<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - LSI Logic started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - LSI Logic started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James initiated coverage of LSI Logic Corp with an accumulate rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was down 3/8 at 31-1/4 in midmorning exchange trading.</p>
